By executing this Contributor License Agreement ("CLA"), the contributor licenses all contributions to Bittensor Subnet 118 (SN118) under the MIT License and grants Ditto Assistant the right to use, modify, distribute, and commercialize all submitted artifacts and code. The contributor warrants that they hold all necessary rights to make the submission and that any third-party model weights comply with permissible commercial redistribution terms.
